-- Toll gates and tariffs, generated by cmd/import-toll.
--
-- Idempotent: gates upsert on their normalised name and tariffs on
-- (entry, exit, golongan, source), so re-applying a corrected file is safe.
--
-- One transaction. A partial load would leave tariffs whose gates are
-- missing, and the pricer would then refuse every route through them
-- without anything saying why.
